OL,3,CBurnham must go further and faster on
OL,4,Ccost of living, says SNP
OL,6,FThe SNP has urged the Prime Minister
OL,7,Fto go "further and faster" on the cost
OL,8,Fof living, claiming families in
OL,9,FScotland will see "no meaningful
OL,10,Fbenefit" from measures announced in
OL,11,Fhis first week.
OL,13,FIn his inaugural Cabinet meeting, Andy
OL,14,FBurnham told ministers they would be a
OL,15,F"cost-of-living Government", before
OL,16,Fannouncing plans to cut VAT on
OL,17,Felectricity bills.
