OL,3,CBurnham must go further and faster on
OL,4,Ccost of living, says SNP
OL,6,FBut, with mortgage costs increasing
OL,7,Fand the price of oil rising to 100 US
OL,8,Fdollars a barrel, the SNP has urged
OL,9,Fthe Prime Minister to do more to
OL,10,Ftackle the spiralling cost of living,
OL,11,Fwith the party's economy spokeswoman,
OL,12,FKirsty Blackman, saying: "Andy Burnham
OL,13,Fmust go much further and faster to
OL,14,Fhelp households with the soaring cost
OL,15,Fof living in the UK, and to reverse
OL,16,Fthe damage done under the Labour
OL,17,Fgovernment, which has left many people
OL,18,Fhundreds of pounds worse off.
OL,26,@tD@ZOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
