OL,3,CBurnham must go further and faster on
OL,4,Ccost of living, says SNP
OL,6,F"Families in Scotland will get no
OL,7,Fmeaningful benefit from the changes
OL,8,Fannounced so far, which are far too
OL,9,Fsmall to make a real difference.
OL,11,F"The decision to remove VAT from
OL,12,Fenergy bills was welcome but it won't
OL,13,Fcome into effect until October ` and
OL,14,Fit will only save average households
OL,15,Fabout #3 a month, when energy bills
OL,16,Fare #600 higher than the Labour Party
OL,17,Fpromised during the election.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
