OL,3,CBurnham must go further and faster on
OL,4,Ccost of living, says SNP
OL,6,F"That's barely enough to buy a pack of
OL,7,Fbaked beans or a tin of Spam ` let
OL,8,Falone take any meaningful pressure off
OL,9,Fof household spending.
OL,11,F"Under the Labour Government, many
OL,12,Ffamilies are living payday-to-payday,
OL,13,Fthe number of people in poverty has
OL,14,Frisen by half a million and UK
OL,15,Funemployment has increased to a five-
OL,16,Fyear high.
OL,18,F"People are really struggling and we
OL,19,Fneed to see much bolder action to
OL,20,Fensure people are better off ` not
OL,21,Fhundreds of pounds worse off."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUzD@AOU}D@^O]
