OL,3,CBurnham must go further and faster on
OL,4,Ccost of living, says SNP
OL,6,FFollowing the first face-to-face
OL,7,Fmeeting between the Prime Minister and
OL,8,FFirst Minister John Swinney, a Downing
OL,9,FStreet spokesman said: "The Prime
OL,10,FMinister stated up front that another
OL,11,Freferendum on independence was off
OL,12,Flimits because it would take our focus
OL,13,Faway from growing the economy and
OL,14,Fhelping families with the cost of
OL,15,Fliving."
